{
  "name": "Social Publisher (Rankflow)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Social Publisher (Rankflow Social Studio)\nEvery 15 minutes: asks the dashboard for approved posts that are due, posts each one to Facebook, Instagram and LinkedIn, and reports the result back. The same call also keeps the dashboard making drafts (captions and images) in the background.\n\n**Setup (once):**\n1. **Dashboard API** credential on the 2 green-header HTTP nodes (Get Due Posts, Report ...): same Header Auth you use for WF1/WF2.\n2. **Facebook Graph account** on the 2 *Get Page Token* nodes (already set if you imported flow 4 on this n8n).\n3. **LinkedIn** credential on *Post to LinkedIn* and *LinkedIn First Comment*: LinkedIn OAuth2 with **Organization Support** on, signed in as an admin of the company pages.\n4. Activate.\n\nPage IDs and the LinkedIn company ID come from each project's settings in the dashboard.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "3f279dc7-4df2-4e85-b62a-d7426abe5966",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
